<li>Fully Furnished Homes<br>Every apartment comes beautifully furnished with bespoke interiors and premium branded furniture.</li><li>Jumeirah Garden City Address<br>A prestigious location positioned between Sheikh Zayed Road and Dubai's most iconic landmarks.</li><li>Views of Dubai's Skyline<br>Selected residences overlook Burj Khalifa, Dubai Frame and the Museum of the Future.</li><li>Luxury Concierge Services<br>Residents benefit from housekeeping, airport transfers, grocery assistance and private chef experiences.</li><li>Wellness-Focused Lifestyle<br>Infinity lap pool, sauna suites, jogging track, landscaped gardens and modern fitness facilities encourage healthy living.</li><li>Future-Ready Living<br>Smart home automation, EV charging, efficient cooling systems and sustainable design enhance everyday comfort.</li><li>Excellent Investment Opportunity<br>A boutique project in one of Dubai's most sought-after city locations offers excellent long-term appreciation potential with limited residential supply.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2233,"cta":{"id":3066,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_1_8c42a43c98.jpg","hash":"Map_1_8c42a43c98","name":"Map-1.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Live Between Dubai's Icons","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Elmora by Neoterra in Al Satwa places residents in the heart of Jumeirah Garden City, a vibrant urban neighbourhood that continues to benefit from significant redevelopment and infrastructure improvements. The community offers quick access to Sheikh Zayed Road, connecting residents to Dubai's major commercial centres, leisure attractions and lifestyle destinations. Landmarks including Burj Khalifa, Dubai Frame, Museum of the Future, City Walk and La Me