ment opportunity.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Elmora by Neoterra a good investment?"},{"id":10560,"answer":"<p>Residents enjoy an infinity pool, gymnasium, sauna suites, concierge services, landscaped gardens, co-working spaces, business lounge and smart home features.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are available at Elmora by Neoterra?"},{"id":10561,"answer":"<p>Yes. Every residence comes fully furnished with bespoke interiors and premium branded furniture.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Elmora Residence Dubai fully furnished?"},{"id":10562,"answer":"<p>Yes. Apartments include smart home automation for lighting and air conditioning, along with EV-ready parking and energy-efficient systems.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Does Elmora offer smart home features?"},{"id":10563,"answer":"<p>The project combines a boutique collection of just 85 residences with fully furnished homes, luxury concierge services and a prestigious central Dubai location.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What makes Elmora by Neoterra unique?"},{"id":10564,"answer":"<p>Elmora consists of only 85 exclusive residences, creating a low-density and private living environment.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"How many residences are available?"},{"id":10565,"answer":"<p>Yes. Concierge services include housekeeping, airport transfers, grocery handling and private chef experiences.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Does Elmora have concierge services?"},{"id":10566,"answer":"<p>Yes. Downtown Dubai, DIFC, City Walk and other major destinations are all within a short drive thanks to the project's central location.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Elmora close to Downtown Dubai?"},{"id":10567,"answer":"<p>Yes. Eligible international buyers can purchase property in accordance with Dubai's freehold ownership regulations.</p>","question":"Can international buyers purchase Elmora by Neoterra?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src